{title: I Sing Praises To Your Name}
{key: G}

{comment: Verse 1}
[G]I sing praises to Your [Cmaj7]name O   [D7]Lord
Praises to Your [Bm7]name O [Em]Lord
For Your [C]name is great
And [D]greatly to be [G7]praised[G]
{ci: (repeat)}

{comment: Verse 2}
[G]I give glory to Your [Cmaj7]name O   [D7]Lord
Glory to Your [Bm7]name O [Em]Lord
For Your [C]name is great
And [D]greatly to be [G7]praised[G]
{ci: (repeat)}
